\right.
\]
where $(\alpha_1/\beta_1, \alpha_2/\beta_2)\in \mathbb{F}^2$ is the critical point of $\mathcal{P}$  and, for $i\in \{1,2\}$, $N_i= \alpha_{i} q_i -\beta_{i} p_i$,

